# Installed system only (needs a Btrfs root, so not used in WSL):
# snapshots before every apt run + restore from the boot menu (grub-btrfs is built from upstream
# in the ISO since Debian doesn't package it), compressed RAM swap, out-of-memory guard,
# automatic security updates.
btrfs-progs timeshift zram-tools systemd-oomd unattended-upgrades
# grub-btrfs (built in the ISO) needs these
inotify-tools gawk git make
